            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A photovoltaic device (6500) comprising:a thin film perovskite material comprising formamidinium lead iodide (FAPbI&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;3&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt;) (6504) wherein the FAPbI&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;3&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt; has a cubic crystal structure and is in contact with a thin-film interfacial layer.</p>
